            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nThis is somewhat expected, though:\r\n- There is only one item present.\r\n- As `evaluate_single` is `true`, it gets evaluated.\r\n- Refresh starter buffer.\r\n- There is only one item present.\r\n- ...\r\n\r\nI'll take a look if there is a reasonable approach to mitigate this.",
